{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004_03_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3bf446d55f40d76667707ee45a401d81d9c0b5d013098243151e938f373d4c18",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000030:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a197c6b4fd814f9d8dc54e01d440e2a64fb01046a0e5ebeb50f3b9cd6aa6e2c",
      "text": "那么大家，今天也辛苦啦。\n特别是皮埃尔。回去要好好休息哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f16f9472fed1f532482fea89601bd535c93737c2a94412c4ba042ab0ee716f8",
      "text": "嗯……我累坏了……呼噜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b1b271ac194cbcb80c6d3ab35a2a3a3b1c7317df017bc99ded0f283088d57f",
      "text": "因为今天为了填好简历，\n一直都在和日语大眼瞪小眼嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31f13cbedd65f06dd0d6d270ab598cbd67111177f64f9e303fa72a772537773f",
      "text": "这次要思考和要写的东西，\n确实有很多啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db366e14db7f0c5cc12e2944f09069f633157830f6d943f23e3802a65f44d120",
      "text": "不过你很了不起哦，皮埃尔。\n确确实实靠自己的力量写完了一整张。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aa785a0d0be075cd1476ca11698b374eea5d104b0a933ea9566f92f2a0267a1",
      "text": "嗯……嘿嘿，我很努力了……呼噜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59af729e72e6420831d39715746c9cb166aa6b9ad087a9a8917abddcbdb2ecf8",
      "text": "实，还有恭二，谢谢你们……\n先、帮我的、写好了……呼噜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddb51599dc26f3943db4c35ed07b39b20e02af0def9ef0243f10cad0c05c993f",
      "text": "行了行了。你看，保镖先生在担心你了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97c6ae5fc1a81dc75c30eb4c64cf029af3c4420701d78edc74cb0d00b026b676",
      "text": "对了，恭二。关于贴在简历上的照片，\n照相馆的大叔说可以帮我们拍哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6055fb6f3a702f9c247423f146d02ad137094aaa83db2e154825bf4a7a45ae39",
      "text": "诶。是我们商店街那家吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72a9b29b4bfea9905817c6bee82ebae793a7de77fb9f998d75cd476dacbfa8c1",
      "text": "嗯。我和他说想为了世界和平以偶像为目标，\n他就说愿意帮忙……大家都是好人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
